<p>EDIT: doh I remember why it was SAFE now. This skip is all about the reveal. I used the safe category because when you start reading the narrative, it's contained. It's only until near the very end that the phone is revealed to be gone. I didn't want anything to make people think &quot;why is it Euclid if its safely contained?&quot; and I wanted to throw in some naughty misdirection.</p>
