<li>Tale centered on long-term effects of testing (wonder who all the D-class killed off when they went? Any major criminal organizations suddenly having power vacuums?)</li>
<li>Tale centered on O5-? (horror factor of sword-of-damocles)</li>
<li>Tale centered on operational issues caused by modified/deleted staff</li>
<li>&quot;standard&quot; SCP with operational issues from this overlapping (risky for public opinion)</li>
</ul>
<p>There's SO much room to go on. Have you already determined Lazarus' actual plans? That's the first step. Where the phone goes/who dies/who changes is next. Finally, who wins? If you're going for a serial format, this can take multiple tales to achieve.</p>
<p>Hope this helps at all!</p>
<p>+1 for massively underestimated danger</p>

